College Management Lightning Application — Exact Exam Steps

Problem Statement:
Develop a College Management Lightning Application to manage Student and Faculty records with validation rules.

STEP 1 — CREATE STUDENT OBJECT

Go:

Setup → Object Manager → Create → Custom Object

Fill:

Field	Value
Label	Student
Object Name	Student

Save.

STEP 2 — CREATE STUDENT FIELDS

Go:

Student → Fields & Relationships → New

Create:

Field Name	Type
Student Name	Text
Roll Number	Number
Marks	Number
Email	Email
STEP 3 — CREATE STUDENT VALIDATION RULES

Go:

Student → Validation Rules → New
Marks Validation

Rule Name:

MarksValidation

Formula:

OR(
    Marks__c < 0,
    Marks__c > 100
)

Error:

Marks must be between 0 and 100
Roll Number Validation

Formula:

Roll_Number__c <= 0

Error:

Roll Number must be greater than 0
Email Validation

Formula:

NOT(
    CONTAINS(
        Email__c,
        "@"
    )
)

Error:

Email must contain @
Student Name Validation

Formula:

ISBLANK(Student_Name__c)

Error:

Student Name cannot be blank
STEP 4 — CREATE FACULTY OBJECT

Go:

Setup → Object Manager → Create → Custom Object

Fill:

Field	Value
Label	Faculty
Object Name	Faculty

Save.

STEP 5 — CREATE FACULTY FIELDS

Go:

Faculty → Fields & Relationships → New

Create:

Field Name	Type
Faculty Name	Text
Faculty ID	Number
Salary	Number
Department	Picklist
Joining Date	Date
STEP 6 — ADD PICKLIST VALUES

For Department field:

Add:

IT
CS
EXTC
Mechanical

Save.

STEP 7 — FACULTY VALIDATION RULES

Go:

Faculty → Validation Rules → New
Faculty Name Validation

Formula:

LEN(Faculty_Name__c) < 3

Error:

Faculty name must contain at least 3 characters
Faculty ID Validation

Formula:

Faculty_ID__c <= 0

Error:

Faculty ID must be greater than 0
Unique Faculty ID

Go:

Faculty_ID__c field

Tick:

Unique

Save.

Salary Validation

Formula:

OR(
    Salary__c < 10000,
    Salary__c > 500000
)

Error:

Salary must be between 10000 and 500000
Joining Date Validation

Formula:

Joining_Date__c > TODAY()

Error:

Joining date cannot be future date
STEP 8 — CREATE STUDENT TAB

Go:

Setup → Tabs → New Custom Object Tab

Choose:

Student

Choose any icon.

Save.

STEP 9 — CREATE FACULTY TAB

Same process:

Setup → Tabs → New Custom Object Tab

Choose:

Faculty

Save.

STEP 10 — CREATE LIGHTNING APP

Go:

Setup → App Manager → New Lightning App

Name:

College Management App

Next → Next.

STEP 11 — ADD NAVIGATION ITEMS

Add:

Students
Faculties

Move to right side.

Finish.

STEP 12 — ENABLE PROFILE ACCESS

Go:

App Manager → College Management App → Edit

Open:

User Profiles

Enable:

System Administrator

Save.

STEP 13 — OPEN APP

Top-left:

9 dots → App Launcher

Search:

College Management App

Open it.

STEP 14 — TEST VALIDATIONS
STUDENT TESTS
Invalid Input	Expected Result
Marks = 150	validation error
Roll Number = -1	validation error
Email without @	validation error
Blank student name	validation error
